  biomeName: Tier 19 West Reserve
  minDepthMeters: 8225
  maxDepthMeters: 8750
  shortDescription: Reserved biome slot for Tier 19 / West. The 108-biome matrix
    expects a bespoke authored identity here; final lore and geology are pending
    expansion from the master vision.
  isPlaceholder: 1
  visitPurpose: Deep-pressure biome. Come here with purpose, stronger gear, and a
    plan to keep orientation in soft terrain and hunt hidden value.
  commonRewardHook: Even routine value here comes from Tungsten Chunk and Rare Earth
    Dust.
  rareRewardHook: 'The reason to risk the trip is: Lithium Crystal and Power Coupler.'
  landmarkIdentity: Tier 19 West Reserve reads through dunes, plains, void cuts,
    and shape changes in the floor. Landmarks should feel scarce but memorable.
  safePocketIdentity: 'Safe pockets are short-lived and mostly procedural: a lee
    side, a bowl edge, a dead current seam.'
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: orientation loss and long empty recovery swims,
    depth stress, and expensive hesitation. Creature pressure stays high.'
  extractionFocus: 'Fissure-edge scavenging, hard geometry, and exposed recovery
    points. Deep tier: accept longer sweeps and weaker orientation during gathering,
    extract only what justifies the risk, and leave cleanly.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is fracture mouth or gate-like break. This
    slot should read through one violent split in the world surface; use silhouette
    changes to avoid getting lost in soft terrain.
